@api = http://localhost:5000

### Kiem tra API dang chay
GET {{api}}/

### Lay danh sach bai tap
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Tao luot nop hop le
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/bai-tap-1" }

### Thieu studentCode -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/x" }

### Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200 OK
@submissionId = {{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}

### Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
